^warning: ignoring
expected constant expression
--
A constexpr function returning __builtin_is_constant_evaluated() (type
_Bool) gave an unfolded `(_Bool)true' during constant evaluation, which is
not a constant: the constexpr variable was initialized at run time (2) and
the case label was rejected, dropping should_escape's body.
